#: ../drivers/ft2800.py:206
msgid ""
"1. Turn radio off.\n"
"2. Connect cable\n"
"3. Press and hold in the MHz, Low, and D/MR keys on the radio while turning it on\n"
"4. Radio is in clone mode when TX/RX is flashing\n"
"5. <b>After clicking OK</b>, press the MHz key on the radio to send image.\n"
"    (\"TX\" will appear on the LCD). \n"
msgstr ""
"1. Vypněte stanici.\n"
"2. Připojte programovací kabel.\n"
"3. Při současném držení tlačítka příslušného tlačítka zapněte stanici.\n"
"4. Radio is in clone mode when TX/RX is flashing\n"
"5. Po kliknutí na OK stiskněte tlačítko na stanici pro zahájení přenosu.\n"
"    ((\"TX\" will appear on the LCD).\n"
"\n"

#: ../drivers/ft2800.py:216
msgid ""
"1. Turn radio off.\n"
"2. Connect cable\n"
"3. Press and hold in the MHz, Low, and D/MR keys on the radio while turning it on\n"
"4. Radio is in clone mode when TX/RX is flashing\n"
"5. Press the Low key on the radio (\"RX\" will appear on the LCD).\n"
"6. Click OK."
msgstr ""
"1. Vypněte stanici.\n"
